{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/932811-what-percentage-of-the-population-are-supernaturals-in-the-world-of-darkness","id":932811,"title":"What Percentage of the population are supernaturals in the world of darkness ?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-07-16T23:26:24-07:00","id":932811,"title":"What Percentage of the population are supernaturals in the world of darkness ?","content":"I got into an interesting talk with my players. Players tend to run into supernaturals more the normal so the question became what are the percentages of each type of supernaturals in the world ?<br /> <br /> Vampires maybe 1 per 1000 ?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-16T23:31:19-07:00","id":932813,"title":"","content":"I believe a random percentage I remember hearing elsewhere was that the total population of earth was at least 60% Human and at most 40% Supernatural.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Currently Doing: Siren the Drowning (Fansplat Ressurection) <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/779860-siren-the-surfacing-nwod-abandoned-fangame-resurrection\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...e-resurrection</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9750-saulotthegentle","name":"SaulottheGentle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9750_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"453"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-16T23:45:06-07:00","id":932817,"title":"","content":"I think that seems kind of excessive. For Vampires, I recall that there's something like 1 Vampire per 10000 mortals. A lot of things depend on how one defines &quot;Supernatural.&quot; A person with 1 dot of Kinfolk is on some level supernatural. So is somebody who has made a pact with a Changeling or Demon. So is a Sleepwalker. Hell, so is someone who has an Unseen Sense. If you cast your net wide enough. Figure somewhere between 1 - 10 percent of the planet is &quot;supernatural.&quot; Figure if you limit the pool to Major (or at least &quot;active&quot;) Templates like Mages, Changelings, Psychics or Ghouls, the number is considerably lower.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2318-johntfs","name":"johntfs","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"373"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-16T23:46:04-07:00","id":932818,"title":"","content":"The number that was laid down in Vampire the Requiem -1rst edition (pg.24 - The Body Count) was a world wide ratio of 1 vampire/50,000 mortals. Vampires are considered one of the more populous supernaturals (even with their strict population controls) and the actual ratio in a dense population center can shoot up much higher. Assuming the major splats (Werewolves, Mages) are at that same ratio, with the less common ones (Changelings, Sin - Eaters) and the sincerely rare one (Prometheans, Mummies), and the gamut of minor templates and mortals with supernatural merits, you would still hit a number far less than even 1% of the global population.<br /> <br /> 2nd Edition takes a far more narrative approach a declares that the ratio is whatever you need to make your story work , no need to bother trying to pin down a number.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1420009-the-artificer-s-workshop\" target=\"_blank\">The Artificer's Workshop</a> - A collection of Exalted Artifacts<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/806809-curios-relics-and-tomes\" target=\"_blank\">Curios, Relics, and Tomes</a> - A collection of Relics (Cursed and Otherwise)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/793173-the-horror-show\" target=\"_blank\">The Horror Lab</a> - A collection of Beasts, Monsters and less definable things.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1128197-strange-places#post1128197\" target=\"_blank\">Strange Places</a> - A collection of Dark, Mysterious, and Wondrous Locations<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/993181-twilight-menagerie\" target=\"_blank\">Twilight Menagerie</a> - A collection of Ephemeral Entities","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/775-reighnhell","name":"Reighnhell","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar775_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"749"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-17T01:24:22-07:00","id":932837,"title":"","content":"Werewolves in first efition were 1/12,000 roughly (it was established that there were 500,000 werewolves around the world).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>LAND OF THE DAMNED: SPAIN (Spanish): </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl